      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Two ways of executing the code:\n\n1. node app.js -> shows the output on\n    the terminal\n2. ctrl + ` -> opens the terminal\n    navigate to the folder or file\n    execute the file -> node app.js",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Two ways of executing the code:\n\n1. node app.js -> shows the output on\n    the terminal\n2. ctrl + ` -> opens the terminal\n    navigate to the folder or file\n    execute the file -> node app.js",
